<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="ko"><head>{{>layout/favicon}}<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>찜한 오브젝트</title><script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"></head><body class="min-h-screen bg-[#0d0e12] text-white">{{>layout/header}}<main class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-8"><a href="/cosmo/objekt" class="text-sm text-teal-300">← 전체 오브젝트</a><h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold">찜한 오브젝트</h1><div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-5">{{#favorites}}<article class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04]"><a href="/cosmo/objekt/detail/{{objektKey}}"><img src="{{thumbnailImage}}" alt="{{collectionId}}" loading="lazy" class="aspect-[2/3] w-full object-cover"></a><div class="p-3"><a href="/cosmo/objekt/detail/{{objektKey}}" class="font-semibold hover:text-teal-300">{{collectionId}}</a><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-400">{{memberName}} · {{season}} · {{collectionNo}}</p></div></article>{{/favorites}}{{^favorites}}<p class="col-span-full py-12 text-center text-slate-400">아직 찜한 오브젝트가 없습니다.</p>{{/favorites}}</div></main></body></html>